Wisecrack fan would get,

00:01:16.030 --> 00:01:18.010
and to chat with Wisecrack
hosts and writers

00:01:18.010 --> 00:01:20.470
about what they're watching,
reading, and playing.

00:01:20.470 --> 00:01:23.230
It also gets you access
to exclusive hangouts

00:01:23.230 --> 00:01:24.830
where we talk about recent videos,

00:01:24.830 --> 00:01:26.430
what we're currently working on,

00:01:26.430 --> 00:01:29.020
and occasionally chat
